OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry night
OL,6,Fwith variable cloud and clear spells,
OL,7,Fwith mist and fog patches forming in
OL,8,Finland rural spots. Chillier than on
OL,9,FWednesday night and breezy over high
OL,10,Fground.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FEarly mist and fog clears
OL,13,Fleaving a bright and dry day for many
OL,14,Fwith light winds. Temperatures close
OL,15,Fto the average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
