OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FThere
OL,6,Fremains a risk of fog overnight which
OL,7,Fmay linger through the morning.
OL,8,FOtherwise, dry and sunny on Saturday,
OL,9,Fthen turning cloudier on Sunday before
OL,10,Fbrighter spells return on Monday.
